  "ruleText": "Liq 101.01 Statutory Definitions Adopted. Unless otherwise indicated, all words used in these rules shall have the same meaning given them by RSA 126-K and RSA 175 - RSA 180.\n\nSource. Editorial Addition.; ss by #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss by #6363, eff 10-26-96; ss by 13612, eff 4-25-23",
